        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9023P, Ultima Hangar Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hangar Door Pull has an industrial-chic look that will really stand out on your front door or office building. This Omnia Ultima II 9023P Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths in a wide array of modern finish colors. The Ultima Hangar Pull comes packaged with the thru-bolt hardware you'll need to install it.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Hangar Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9023P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9023P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9023P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/hangar-back-to-back-door-pull-pair-omnia-btb-9023p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
